            "title": "学习笔记：中国剩余定理",
            "date_published": "2023-05-27T09:12:13.000Z",
            "content_html": "<p>upd on 04/27/25：发现该文没写完 <img src=\"/em/qd.gif\" /></p>\r\n<span id=\"more\"></span>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2 id=\"中国剩余定理\">中国剩余定理</h2>\r\n<p>给定下列关于 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(x\\)</span>\r\n的一元同余方程组：</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"math display\">\\[\r\n\\begin {cases}\r\nx \\equiv a_1 \\pmod {m_1}  \\\\\r\nx \\equiv a_2 \\pmod {m_2}  \\\\\r\n\\quad \\quad \\vdots \\\\\r\nx \\equiv a_k \\pmod {m_k}\r\n\\end {cases}\r\n\\]</span> 其中对于 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\forall \\, 1\\le i, j\\le\r\nk\\, (i\\ne j)\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(m_i \\,\r\n\\bot\\,  m_j\\)</span>。下面是求解该方程组的具体方法：</p>\r\n<p>令 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(M = \\prod \\limits _{i = 1} ^ k m_i, \\,\r\nM_i=\\dfrac M {m_i}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(x = \\sum\r\n\\limits _{i = 1} ^k a_i\\times M_i\\times M_i ^{-1} \\pmod M\\)</span>。</p>\r\n<p>其中，<span class=\"math inline\">\\(M_i^{-1}\\)</span> 是 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(M_i\\)</span> 在模 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(m_i\\)</span> 意义下的逆元（所以 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(M_i\\times M_i^{-1}\\)</span> 的值并不是视觉上的\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(1\\)</span>）。</p>\r\n<p>正确性证明：对于 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\forall \\, i\\in \\{1, 2,\r\n\\cdots, k\\}\\)</span>，有 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(M_i\\mid\r\nM\\)</span>；对于 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\forall \\, j\\in \\{1, 2,\r\n\\cdots, k\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(j\\ne i\\)</span>，有\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(m_i\\mid \\dfrac M{m_j}\\)</span> 即 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(m_i\\mid M_j\\)</span>，即 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(M_j\\equiv 0\\pmod {m_i}\\)</span>。</p>\r\n<p>又 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(m_i\\mid M\\)</span> 那么就有 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(x\\equiv a_i\\cdot M_i\\cdot {M_i}^{-1}\\equiv\r\na_i\\pmod {n_i}\\)</span>。</p>\r\n<p>时间复杂度 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(O(n\\log\r\nn)\\)</span>。注意求解逆元时要用到 exgcd。</p>\r\n<details>\r\n<div class=\"sourceCode\" id=\"cb1\"><pre\r\nclass=\"sourceCode cpp\"><code class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><span id=\"cb1-1\"><a href=\"#cb1-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"dt\">int</span> CRT<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> k<span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"dt\">int</span> <span class=\"op\">*</span>a<span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"dt\">int</span> <span class=\"op\">*</span>m<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-2\"><a href=\"#cb1-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"dt\">int</span> M <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> x <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">0</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-3\"><a href=\"#cb1-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"at\">static</span> <span class=\"dt\">int</span> M1<span class=\"op\">[</span>maxn<span class=\"op\">],</span> Mi<span class=\"op\">[</span>maxn<span class=\"op\">];</span> </span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-4\"><a href=\"#cb1-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> i <span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span> k<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>i<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-5\"><a href=\"#cb1-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        M <span class=\"op\">*=</span> m<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">];</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-6\"><a href=\"#cb1-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> i <span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span> k<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>i<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-7\"><a href=\"#cb1-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        M1<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">=</span> M <span class=\"op\">/</span> m<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">];</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-8\"><a href=\"#cb1-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        Mi<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">=</span> getinv<span class=\"op\">(</span>M1<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">],</span> m<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-9\"><a href=\"#cb1-9\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"op\">(</span>x <span class=\"op\">+=</span> a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">*</span> M1<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">*</span> Mi<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">])</span> <span class=\"op\">%=</span> M<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-10\"><a href=\"#cb1-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-11\"><a href=\"#cb1-11\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">return</span> x<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-12\"><a href=\"#cb1-12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span></code></pre></div>\r\n</details>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2 id=\"扩展中国剩余定理\">扩展中国剩余定理</h2>\r\n<p>设有如下同余方程组：</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"math display\">\\[\r\n\\begin {cases}\r\nx \\equiv a_1 \\pmod {m_1} \\\\\r\nx \\equiv a_2 \\pmod {m_2}\r\n\\end {cases}\r\n\\]</span></p>\r\n<p>不保证 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(m_1 \\, \\bot \\, m_2\\)</span>。</p>\r\n<p>设 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(x = m_1 \\times p_1 + a_1 = m_2 \\times\r\np_2 + a_2\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(p_i \\in \\mathbb\r\nZ\\)</span>，则有 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(p_1 \\times m_1 - p_2 \\times\r\nm_2 = a_2 - a_1\\)</span>。</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(p_1\\)</span> 的值可以用 exgcd\r\n求解，则原方程的解满足 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(x \\equiv m_1\\times\r\np_1 + a_1 \\pmod {M}\\)</span>，其中 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(M=\\operatorname{lcm}(m_1, m_2)\\)</span>。</p>\r\n<p>这样我们就得到了一个新的同余方程。对于 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(k&gt;2\\)</span>\r\n的情况，我们不断合并两个同余方程即可得到最终同余方程。</p>\r\n<p>此时根据题目要求（一般求最小值即 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(m_k\\times p_k + a_k\\)</span>）求解答案即可。</p>\r\n<p>时间复杂度 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(O(n\\log n)\\)</span>，其中\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\log\\)</span> 来自 exgcd。</p>\r\n<details>\r\n<div class=\"sourceCode\" id=\"cb2\"><pre\r\nclass=\"sourceCode cpp\"><code class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><span id=\"cb2-1\"><a href=\"#cb2-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"dt\">int</span> calc<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> m1<span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"dt\">int</span> a1<span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"dt\">int</span> m2<span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"dt\">int</span> a2<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-2\"><a href=\"#cb2-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"dt\">int</span> p1<span class=\"op\">,</span> p2<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-3\"><a href=\"#cb2-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">if</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span>a2 <span class=\"op\">-</span> a1 <span class=\"op\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"dv\">0</span><span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-4\"><a href=\"#cb2-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        swap<span class=\"op\">(</span>a1<span class=\"op\">,</span> a2<span class=\"op\">),</span> swap<span class=\"op\">(</span>m1<span class=\"op\">,</span> m2<span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-5\"><a href=\"#cb2-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"dt\">int</span> g <span class=\"op\">=</span> exgcd<span class=\"op\">(</span>m1<span class=\"op\">,</span> p1<span class=\"op\">,</span> m2<span class=\"op\">,</span> p2<span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-6\"><a href=\"#cb2-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">if</span> <span class=\"op\">((</span>a2 <span class=\"op\">-</span> a1<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">%</span> g<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-7\"><a href=\"#cb2-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"cf\">return</span> <span class=\"op\">-</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-8\"><a href=\"#cb2-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    p1 <span class=\"op\">*=</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span>a2 <span class=\"op\">-</span> a1<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">/</span> g<span class=\"op\">,</span> m2 <span class=\"op\">/=</span> g<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-9\"><a href=\"#cb2-9\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    p1 <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span>p1 <span class=\"op\">%</span> m2 <span class=\"op\">+</span> m2<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">%</span> m2<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-10\"><a href=\"#cb2-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">return</span> p1 <span class=\"op\">*</span> m1 <span class=\"op\">+</span> a1<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-11\"><a href=\"#cb2-11\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-12\"><a href=\"#cb2-12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"dt\">int</span> exCRT<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> k<span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"dt\">int</span> <span class=\"op\">*</span>a<span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"dt\">int</span> <span class=\"op\">*</span>m<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-13\"><a href=\"#cb2-13\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">2</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> i <span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span> k<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>i<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-14\"><a href=\"#cb2-14\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">=</span> calc<span class=\"op\">(</span>m<span class=\"op\">[</span>i <span class=\"op\">-</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">],</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-15\"><a href=\"#cb2-15\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>                a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i <span class=\"op\">-</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">],</span> m<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">],</span> a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-16\"><a href=\"#cb2-16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"cf\">if</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span>a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">==</span> <span class=\"op\">-</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-17\"><a href=\"#cb2-17\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            <span class=\"cf\">return</span> <span class=\"op\">-</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-18\"><a href=\"#cb2-18\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        m<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">=</span> lcm<span class=\"op\">(</span>m<span class=\"op\">[</span>i <span class=\"op\">-</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">],</span> m<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-19\"><a href=\"#cb2-19\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-20\"><a href=\"#cb2-20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">return</span> a<span class=\"op\">[</span>k<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">%</span> m<span class=\"op\">[</span>k<span class=\"op\">];</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-21\"><a href=\"#cb2-21\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span></code></pre></div>\r\n</details>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3 id=\"d.-strange-way-to-express-integers\">D. Strange Way to Express\r\nIntegers</h3>\r\n<p><a href=\"http://222.180.160.110:1024/contest/3642/problem/4\"\r\nclass=\"uri\">http://222.180.160.110:1024/contest/3642/problem/4</a></p>\r\n<p>板。但是要开 <code>__int128</code>。不知道为什么智力只用开\r\n<code>long long</code> 就能跑过，我和揭哥就不行。</p>\r\n<details>\r\n<div class=\"sourceCode\" id=\"cb3\"><pre\r\nclass=\"sourceCode cpp\"><code class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><span id=\"cb3-1\"><a href=\"#cb3-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#define int </span><span class=\"dt\">__int128</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-2\"><a href=\"#cb3-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"kw\">namespace</span> XSC062 <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-3\"><a href=\"#cb3-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"kw\">using</span> <span class=\"kw\">namespace</span> fastIO<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-4\"><a href=\"#cb3-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"at\">const</span> <span class=\"dt\">int</span> maxn <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"fl\">1e5</span> <span class=\"op\">+</span> <span class=\"dv\">5</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-5\"><a href=